# Wiki pages another branch is still writing: the wiki-tools half.
#
# udeaVerifyWiki lets Home.md and _Sidebar.md link to these before they exist. It fails when a
# listed page is present, so the branch that merges last deletes the entry, and then this file.
#
# The six pages this branch wrote - Getting-Started, Rendering-with-Kool, Models-and-Animation,
# UI-with-ComposeGL, Input and Cameras - are here now, so their entries are gone.
#
# Building-Hollow-in-the-Editor.md is gone too, and it is the one entry that went for a different
# reason: the page belongs to issue #255, which adds the editor entry point it would describe, so
# nothing links it today. Its entry and its links go back together when the page exists.
Audio.md
The-Editor.md
Gizmos.md
Agent-Tool-Surface.md
Tutorial-Make-a-Game.md
Example-Games.md
